# Automation Testing – Login Module (Entri App)

## 🔧 Tools Used

* Selenium WebDriver
* Python
* TestNG (or PyTest if applicable)

## 📌 Project Overview

This project automates the login and registration functionality of a web application using Selenium.

## ✅ Features Covered

* Login validation (valid & invalid credentials)
* Registration flow
* Error message validation
* Cross-browser testing

## 🚀 Key Achievements

* Reduced manual testing effort by 40%
* Improved regression testing efficiency
* Implemented reusable test scripts

## ▶️ How to Run

1. Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
2. Run tests: `pytest` (or TestNG equivalent)

## 📊 Reports

* Test execution reports generated for analysis
